d_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "### Issue:\nSpecific race condition between [send_capture_status](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/3e26666176bad4a1df51575808fc05ec494abea9/cpp/src/mavsdk/plugins/camera_server/camera_server_impl.cpp#L1370)  and [send_tracking_status_with_interval](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/3e26666176bad4a1df51575808fc05ec494abea9/cpp/src/mavsdk/plugins/camera_server/camera_server_impl.cpp#L2140).\n\n`send_capture_status` locks `_mutex`, before calling `queue_message` and locking `_mavlink_packet_mutex`, `send_tracking_status_with_interval` calls `queue_message`, blocking `_mavlink_packet_mutex`.\n`send_capture_status` gets stuck waiting for `_mavlink_packet_mutex` and `send_tracking_status_with_interval` gets stuck for `_mutex`", "closed_by": {"login": "JoC2000", "id": 40157954, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTU3OTU0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40157954?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JoC2000", "html_url": "https://github.com/JoC2000", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JoC2000/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JoC2000/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JoC2000/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JoC2000/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JoC2000/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JoC2000/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JoC2000/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JoC2000/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JoC2000/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2892/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://